        "url": "https://www.patpat.com/blogs/baby-food/starting-solids-first-foods-guide-4-6-months",
        "description": "If your baby shows all readiness signs between 4-6 months (<strong>head control, sitting with support, loss of tongue thrust reflex</strong>), you can begin. Consult your pediatrician if unsure, especially for babies closer to 4 months.",
